{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477650/extras/cff95b4590d639a81d909c20d68fa1d0.poster.avif?t=1770485713\" width=524 height=2304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477650/extras/cff95b4590d639a81d909c20d68fa1d0.webm?t=1770485713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477650/extras/cff95b4590d639a81d909c20d68fa1d0.mp4?t=1770485713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Themes &amp; More</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The base game includes <strong>Horror</strong>,\u00a0<strong>Pirates, Fantasy, Apocalypse, Sci-Fi &amp; Western\u00a0</strong>\u2014jump in and play. Each theme has its own twists, characters, and ways to play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love scary stories? Jump into our original <strong>Horror</strong> theme. Face creepy plot-point events that shake up each round and keep your nerves on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477650/extras/e771ed4f4fa10e94002813227323c62c.avif?t=1770485713\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pirates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want more spice? Sail to the <strong>Pirate</strong> theme, where you buy and sell usable items between rounds. Fire cannonballs at your crewmates, sip rum to boost Bonus Word points, and trade goods to stack doubloons\u2014the richest crew at the end wins.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477650/extras/d32b35ae3ad77af22740a41901a68126.avif?t=1770485713\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Elves vs Samurai\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Elves vs Samurai</strong>, lands on Steam soon. Teams split down the middle: defend the realm as the honorable Samurai or sow chaos as the dark Elves. Work with your side to outplay the opposition, and settle close votes the old way\u2014<strong>duels</strong>. Step up, represent your team, and defend your honor.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477650/extras/5914eb5fcf0f0b0800c349b36ca4acb7.avif?t=1770485713\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br>What's your story?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477650/extras/42278132b6866338f529f983d1b74e76.poster.avif?t=1770485713\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477650/extras/42278132b6866338f529f983d1b74e76.webm?t=1770485713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477650/extras/42278132b6866338f529f983d1b74e76.mp4?t=1770485713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2477650?t=1770485713","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770485713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477650/c9867a3b06cea8532c6fcc5dd23606788e36623c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770485713","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477650/c9867a3b06cea8532c6fcc5dd23606788e36623c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770485713","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Discord Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477650/extras/cff95b4590d639a81d909c20d68fa1d0.poster.avif?t=1770485713\" width=524 height=2304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477650/extras/cff95b4590d639a81d909c20d68fa1d0.webm?t=1770485713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477650/extras/cff95b4590d639a81d909c20d68fa1d0.mp4?t=1770485713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Themes &amp; More</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The base game includes <strong>Horror</strong>,\u00a0<strong>Pirates, Fantasy, Apocalypse, Sci-Fi &amp; Western\u00a0</strong>\u2014jump in and play. Each theme has its own twists, characters, and ways to play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love scary stories? Jump into our original <strong>Horror</strong> theme. Face creepy plot-point events that shake up each round and keep your nerves on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img